NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

  * The Android ticket-signing libraries under tools/bionic_shim/ are compiled
    artifacts distributed for convenience. libqimei_patched.so is derived from
    the upstream libqimei.so shipped with the Marvis client, with its ELF
    symbol-version table patched by tools/bionic_shim/patch_versym.py. These
    files are not covered by the MIT license above; use them subject to your
    own agreements with the relevant upstream provider.

  * tools/extract_marvis_dll.py copies files that already exist on your own
    machine into this project directory; it bundles nothing itself.

  * Any device identifiers, keys, or credentials required to run this project
    are yours and are never distributed by this repository.
